### Activate Product
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/products/1FD31FA9-8068-45D6-A3F8-4603F31984D6/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}

### Deactivate Product
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/products/1FD31FA9-8068-45D6-A3F8-4603F31984D6/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}

### Increase Quantity
# Auth: Required | Role: Admin
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/products/EA6530C3-8FFC-4D53-8175-15CC6BD06A4C/increase
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}

{
  "quantity": 2
}

### Get Product By Id
# Auth: Not Required | Role: Not Required
GET localhost:5000/api/products/EA6530C3-8FFC-4D53-8175-15CC6BD06A4C

### Get All Products
# Auth: NotRequired | Role: Not Required
GET localhost:5000/api/products

### Get Products By Category Id
# Auth: Not Required | Role: Not Required
GET localhost:5000/api/products/category/15A1759B-7AD1-4691-977C-7969B443C559
